    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tangled Crisis</i> is built around a deceptively simple goal: <strong>escape the maze</strong>. But with <strong>limited visibility</strong>, a <strong>ticking timer</strong>, and <strong>multiple maze layers</strong> stacked across 3D space, players are challenged to <strong>act fast</strong>, <strong>think ahead</strong>, and <strong>memorize</strong> optimal <strong>paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Boost -&gt;</strong> Hit the turbo! Blaze through obstacles with a burst of speed and full-on invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.poster.avif?t=1753343267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.webm?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.mp4?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Vision -&gt;</strong>\u00a0Widen your vision and expose sneaky shortcuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.poster.avif?t=1753343267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.webm?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.mp4?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf52 <strong>Score attack -&gt;</strong>\u00a0Collect coins and fruits like a pro, race to crush your best run, and watch the leftover time turn into extra score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.poster.avif?t=1753343267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.webm?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.mp4?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Gather keys -&gt;</strong> Secure the keys needed to unlock your way to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.poster.avif?t=1753343267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.webm?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.mp4?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Portal jump -&gt;</strong> Explore multi-screen challenges through portals, there is more than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.poster.avif?t=1753343267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.webm?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.mp4?t=1753343267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Diamond Hunt -&gt; Grab all the fruits in a level to make a diamond pop! Use it to unlock skips and replay your favorite days anytime!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of game modes to keep you challenged and entertained, whether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore maze master:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Classic Modes:</strong> Dive into three distinct classic modes (<strong>Casual</strong>, <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Challenge</strong>). Perfect for those who love <strong>structured gameplay</strong> and want to master different maze layouts and puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Arcade:</strong> For players seeking a <strong>nonstop test of skill</strong>, the endless run mode delivers <strong>fast-paced</strong>, <strong>high-intensity</strong> gameplay where the maze never ends. Compete for the top spot on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>, or simply play at your own pace and improve your <strong>personal bests</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing leaderboard glory or just looking for a fun way to sharpen your skills, <i>Tangled Crisis</i> has a <strong>mode that fits your playstyle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Become the Champion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
