l leaderboard</strong>, or simply play at your own pace and improve your <strong>personal bests</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing leaderboard glory or just looking for a fun way to sharpen your skills, <i>Tangled Crisis</i> has a <strong>mode that fits your playstyle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Become the Champion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
